This is the hardware mapping for the new robot configuration:

Control Hub:
    0:lf (front left motor)
    1:lr (rear left motor)
    2:intakeM (intake)
    3:outtakeM (shooter)
    I2C1: pinpoint (pinpoint odometry)
    I2C2: colorSensor (outtake color sensor)
Expansion Hub:
    0:rf (front right motor)
    1:rr (rear right motor)
    2:transferM (transfer motor)

